    <p class="excerpt">Ohne Bild.</p>
  </div>
</li>
      <li class="entry">
  <a href="/2020/10/kurbis/" class="entry-image" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/2020/10/kurbis/200x/k%C3%BCrbis%20thumb.png" width="200" height="150" alt="" loading="lazy"></a>
  <div class="entry-text">
    <p class="entry-title"><a href="/2020/10/kurbis/">Kürbis</a></p>
